    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Astro Engineers is a co-op puzzle game for both virtual reality and desktop where you have to solve puzzles, work together and explore to complete different missions. Play together with players across multiple platforms from anywhere in the world. By exploring the levels together you can find unique solutions to puzzles and secret collectables. <br><br>In either VR or non-vr the game provides a unique experience and allows all players to work together so no friend is left behind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/90cd4f8f6c039cda52a4e6b58de54451.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/90cd4f8f6c039cda52a4e6b58de54451.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/90cd4f8f6c039cda52a4e6b58de54451.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Solve unique puzzles to complete different levels. Remember sequences, calculate formulas and platform together with your friends. Try and interact with everything, the solution is somewhere.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/c7868703cc5e114a33655008c73a628c.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/c7868703cc5e114a33655008c73a628c.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/c7868703cc5e114a33655008c73a628c.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Work together to complete the mission, because why not double, triple or quadruple the fun?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/de13393106a8d666bd6d912cb6065513.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/de13393106a8d666bd6d912cb6065513.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/de13393106a8d666bd6d912cb6065513.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Different missions take you along different locations with each telling a different story. Can you find all the secrets and solve the big puzzle?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/d6fc802e323bbe53f5967ac6cf62aaf3.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/d6fc802e323bbe53f5967ac6cf62aaf3.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/d6fc802e323bbe53f5967ac6cf62aaf3.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unique tools give each player in the group a task to fulfill so you have to be strategic with who goes where in each puzzle.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Astro Engineers is a co-op puzzle game for both virtual reality and desktop where you have to solve puzzles, work together and explore to complete different missions. Play together with players across multiple platforms from anywhere in the world. By exploring the levels together you can find unique solutions to puzzles and secret collectables. <br><br>In either VR or non-vr the game provides a unique experience and allows all players to work together so no friend is left behind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/90cd4f8f6c039cda52a4e6b58de54451.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/90cd4f8f6c039cda52a4e6b58de54451.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/90cd4f8f6c039cda52a4e6b58de54451.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Solve unique puzzles to complete different levels. Remember sequences, calculate formulas and platform together with your friends. Try and interact with everything, the solution is somewhere.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/c7868703cc5e114a33655008c73a628c.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/c7868703cc5e114a33655008c73a628c.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/c7868703cc5e114a33655008c73a628c.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Work together to complete the mission, because why not double, triple or quadruple the fun?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/de13393106a8d666bd6d912cb6065513.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/de13393106a8d666bd6d912cb6065513.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/de13393106a8d666bd6d912cb6065513.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Different missions take you along different locations with each telling a different story. Can you find all the secrets and solve the big puzzle?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/d6fc802e323bbe53f5967ac6cf62aaf3.poster.avif?t=1682978088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/d6fc802e323bbe53f5967ac6cf62aaf3.webm?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407520/extras/d6fc802e323bbe53f5967ac6cf62aaf3.mp4?t=1682978088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unique tools give each player in the group a task to fulfill so you have to be strategic with who goes where in each puzzle.",
